00:58:39.160 --> 00:58:41.640
<v Jessamyn Lovell>Tight black shirt, shiny pants, wedge boots.
<v Jessamyn Lovell>紧身黑衬衫，亮面裤子，坡跟靴。

00:58:41.640 --> 00:58:45.560
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of this American life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。下周带回更多关于美国生活的故事。

00:58:45.560 --> 00:58:50.560
